2026-07-27T12:31:21.0001465Z i /tmp/RtmpTMxniB/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:31:21.0002103Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:31:21.0002594Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:31:21.0003009Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:31:21.0003644Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:31:21.0004838Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:31:21.0005731Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
